title: "Spiral Flow Matching and DMD/DMD2 Distillation"
abstract: >-
  A self-contained eight-spiral toy study: class-conditional CFG flow matching,
  DMD/DMD2 four-step distillation, and frozen clockwise interpolation between
  class conditions.
